WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Research TV v3.0 — eco-stack (45s) Narrator Hakim

1
00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:08.814
First, information theory, game theory, and mechanism design form three altitudes of one energy-bounded computing map.

2
00:00:09.254 --> 00:00:16.591
Second, one prices bits and heat, one maps strategy, and one writes rules where honesty wins.

3
00:00:17.031 --> 00:00:19.734
Third, across every layer of computing,

4
00:00:19.734 --> 00:00:24.448
each action must clear its energy floor and pass independent checks.

5
00:00:24.888 --> 00:00:29.666
Think of a busy city intersection. Physics governs tire grip and fuel burn,

6
00:00:29.666 --> 00:00:37.502
drivers react strategically to one another, and smart traffic lights create rules where waiting your turn beats cutting in.

7
00:00:37.942 --> 00:00:42.744
Viewing bit energy, strategy, and rule design as one connected stack

8
00:00:42.744 --> 00:00:47.901
lets engineers catch hidden waste and bad incentives before systems fail.
